utions</h3><p>The first draft of the manuscript was written by Anuradha Sharma, Naveen Kumar, and Peter R. Makgwane. Eric Lichtfouse, Ahmad Hosseini Bandegharaei, and Muhammad Tahir commented and edited the manuscript. All authors read and approved the final manuscript.</p><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="corresponding-author">Corresponding author</h3><p id="corresponding-author-list">Correspondence to
